 ('utopia','Utopia Sphere','Orion’s Arm Universe Project','https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-topic/45ce5133c0d94','official_worldbuilding','Chesed’s interventionist guidance supports residents through Ecstasy, Fantasy and Serenity with strong rights.','Polities vary; chosen low-tech styles are not assumed to mean absence of underlying provision.'),
 ('communion','Communion of Worlds','Orion’s Arm Universe Project','https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-topic/45cbc752f41f8','official_worldbuilding','Mediator guilds, perspective sharing, diverse local governance and standard Sephirotic infrastructure.','Nonviolence and group minds do not by themselves establish equal productive ownership.'),
 ('uns','United Nations of Sol','Schlock Mercenary Wiki contributors','https://schlockmercenary.fandom.com/wiki/United_Nations_of_Sol','secondary_lore','Plutorliament and various subordinate governments define the UNS.','Government and powerful machines do not establish ordinary work-independent provision.'),
 ('oafa','Post-transuranics and Oafan manufacture','Schlock Mercenary Wiki contributors','https://schlockmercenary.fandom.com/wiki/Post-transuranics','secondary_lore','Ancient Oafan technology produces structural materials efficiently.','Valuable relics and manufacturing scale do not establish civilian allocation; direct Oafa page returned 402.'),
 ('paanuri','Schlock Mercenary, 10 July 2005','Howard Tayler','https://www.schlockmercenary.com/2005-07-10','primary_strip_transcript','The transcript identifies Paan’uri as dark-matter entities and describes conflict.','A bounded strip, not a material-economy description or a human nonworking denominator.'),
 ('freefall','Freefall review','William H. Stoddard, Prometheus/LFS','https://www.lfs.org/newsletter/032/04/Freefall.shtml','secondary_review','Millions of robot workers are treated as equipment and compelled to obey humans; maintenance payment is contested.','2014 review scope; not proof of a universal human basic-income or goods floor.'),
