 ('dresden','Hob 16: Future Memories technical note','Dresden Codak creator','https://dresdencodak.com/2008/01/25/future-memories/','creator_note','Utility-fog machinery explains Hob’s body.','A body mechanism is not a household economy; no complete illustrated arc reconstruction.'),
 ('compact','Compact of Species','The Last Angel Wiki contributors','https://thelastangel.fandom.com/wiki/Compact_of_Species','secondary_lore','AI suppression and species-caste functions characterize the Compact.','Safety/security opposition to AI alone does not establish automation replacing material labor or a distinct work-preservation policy.'),
