 ('17776-review','17776, or What Science Fiction Will Look Like in the Future','Chenyao Liu, 34th Street Magazine','https://www.34st.com/article/2026/04/17776-digital-sci-fi-storytelling-football-jon-bois','secondary_criticism','The work is explicitly interpreted as post-scarcity life organized around artificial stakes and play.','Critical interpretation, not a canonical labor census or an explanation of every production sector.')
